<title>USA: Thornburg to sell $200 mln in securities.</title>
<headline>Thornburg to sell $200 mln in securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thornburg Mortgage Asset Corp said it filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to sell as much as $200 million of the company's securities.</p>
<p>The company did not say when it would sell the securities, which may be in the form of common or preferred stock, warrants or shareholder rights.</p>
<p>The company will use proceeds for general corporate purposes, including reduction of debt and finance future acquisitions, it added.</p>
</text>
